      "detail": {
        "holistic": true,
        "dimension": "type_safety",
        "related_files": [
          "lev/router.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "def question_from_dict(data: dict) -> ... (router.py:4) accesses data.get('type'), data.get('labels'), data.get('question'), data.get('low_anchor'), data.get('high_anchor'), a fixed set of known keys",
          "Callers validate the payload shape in cli.py (isinstance checks on 'questions' list of dicts) before calling, so the expected structure is established"
